		(property "Description" "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U-N8 only: no octalPSRAM. USB device, serial servo bridge, motor PWM/encoders, I2C dual motor-current ADC and battery voltage, I2S audio. Firmware port required; not QT-Py pin-compatible. GPIO1 is a dedicated ARM_COMMIT pulse; GPIO2 reads ARM_LATCHED. A UART packet enable is not an arming event."
